.SH "Detailed Description"
.PP 
Everything about a stroke but the shape it follows\&. 

Passed by value so the eight drawing calls that stroke something keep one parameter rather than five, and so adding to it later touches none of them\&.
.PP
Build one with schultz_stroke_solid or schultz_stroke_make rather than by assigning the fields, so a field added later starts out sensible instead of holding whatever was on the stack\&. 
.PP
